    "url": "https://jensettl.com/PRJ-event-management-plattform/",
    "title": "[PROJECT] Social Media Platform for Event Management",
    "body": "2025/10/05 - My take on tackling the challenge of planning and managing events with different friends, colleagues, or family members. The platform aims for a social media-like approach to facilitate communication, coordination, and organization of events. Project OverviewEvent planning can often be a complex task, especially when coordinating with multiple people. To address this, I developed a web-based platform that combines social media features with event management tools. The goal is to create an intuitive and engaging environment where users can easily plan, share, and manage events.  Since I am lacking frontend development skills, I used bolt. new to quickly prototype the UI. The frontend is built with React, ensuring a responsive and user-friendly experience. The repository is currently private, but I plan to make it public once I have polished the codebase and added more features. If you’re interested in contributing or testing the platform, please reach out to me directly so I can provide access. GitHub Repository Features:  User Authentication: Secure sign-up and login functionality to ensure user data privacy.  Event Creation: Users can create events, set dates, locations, and invite friends Dashboard: A personalized dashboard to view upcoming events, invitations, and notifications.  Chat Functionality: Real-time messaging to facilitate communication among event participants.  Attendance Tracking: Users can RSVP to events and see who else is attending. Page PreviewsDashboard: The dashboard provides users with a quick overview of upcoming events, invitations, and recent activity. It serves as the central hub for managing all event-related tasks.  Event Detail View: The event detail view offers comprehensive information about a specific event, including the date, time, location, and list of attendees. Users can also access the chat feature from this view.  ContributionI am continuously working on adding new features and improving the user experience based on feedback. If you are interested in contributing to the project, feel free to reach out or check the repository for open issues and feature requests. ➡️ GitHub Repository "
